! Include Directory

Includes: 31

* [[bot.ts]] - Core bot bootstrap, banner, help, hotkey, menu, and variable-loading routines.
* [[combat.ts]] - Shared fast-attack, capture, citadel-attack, and holo-kill combat helpers.
* [[connectivity.ts]] - Login, relog, movement-state, and post-login preference helpers.
* [[fighters.ts]] - Shared `fighters` include routines and support labels used across the Mombot source tree.
* [[findproduct.ts]] - Planet-product search helpers used when choosing planets with needed stock or colonists.
* [[game.ts]] - Game-wide metadata parsing, especially game stats and universe-level information.
* [[gameprefs.ts]] - Helpers for applying or restoring game preference settings.
* [[grid.ts]] - Shared surround and grid-control helpers used by several grid and cashing paths.
* [[haggle.ts]] - Port haggle and negotiated trade helper logic.
* [[help.ts]] - Shared `help` include routines and support labels used across the Mombot source tree.
* [[internal_commands.ts]] - Native-bot internal command helpers for timing, relog, and control actions.
* [[invader.ts]] - Shared invader command helpers for checking and starting invade macros.
* [[loadvars.ts]] - Shared `loadvars` include routines and support labels used across the Mombot source tree.
* [[lsd.ts]] - Shared `lsd` include routines and support labels used across the Mombot source tree.
* [[map.ts]] - ANSI map display and navigation rendering helpers.
* [[menus.ts]] - Native menu-building, splash-screen, and preference UI helpers.
* [[merchant.ts]] - Shared `merchant` include routines and support labels used across the Mombot source tree.
* [[mines.ts]] - Mine and limpet deployment/report helpers.
* [[move.ts]] - Shared movement logic for moving product and navigating between sectors or planets.
* [[planet.ts]] - Planet parsing, landing, planet-file loading, and shared planet-state routines.
* [[planethaggle.ts]] - Planet buy/sell haggle routines split out from the larger planet include.
* [[planetnames.ts]] - Planet-name array and planet-list helper routines.
* [[player.ts]] - Prompt, quikstats, movement, formatting, CN, and shared player-state helpers.
* [[port.ts]] - Port build, destroy, upgrade, max, and ship-sale helpers.
* [[search.ts]] - Search helpers for sector and path-based lookups.
* [[sector.ts]] - Sector-data loading helpers for the database and live sector state.
* [[ship.ts]] - Ship computer parsing, ship stat loading, and ship save/load helpers.
* [[switchboard.ts]] - Subspace and switchboard messaging helper routines.
* [[update.ts]] - CIM and fighter update helpers used by update/report paths.
* [[user_interface.ts]] - Command-line dispatch and alias-resolution helpers for the bot shell.
* [[xenter.ts]] - Exit/xenter wrapper routines for leaving sectors or returning from call flows.
